# grade: Π, rejecting: a finding refutes that the definition shows the rule's condition, as written; silence affirms nothing.
# Rule 1: functions are constexpr (or consteval).  Deleted and defaulted
# functions are exempt; lambdas are not a rule of the paper.
match functionDecl(isExpansionInMainFile(), isDefinition(), unless(anyOf(isConstexpr(), isConsteval(), isDeleted(), isDefaulted(), isImplicit(), cxxMethodDecl(ofClass(cxxRecordDecl(isLambda()))))), hasAncestor(scope))
